 ProcessTool_WithCtrlEnter;globalParms;list;parms;n1;result
⍝ Presents a list of any length and allows processing selected rows by pressing Ctrl+Enter
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 list←∪300⍴#.⎕NL-3
 list←list[⍋⊃list]
 parms←##.APLGUI.ProcessTool.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'Process selected items'
 parms.colTitles←,⊂'Numbers'
 parms.style←##.APLGUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.single
 parms.info←'Select as many items as you like and then press Ctrl+Enter'
 parms.useWindowsRegistry←1
 parms.ctrlEnter←1
 parms.dblClick←0
 parms.processBtnCaption←''

 parms.default←{(⍳⍵)∊?⎕IO⊃⍵}⍴list
 n1←globalParms parms ##.APLGUI.ProcessTool.Create list'∆OnTestHandler_ProcessTool'

 result←##.APLGUI.ProcessTool.ModalWait n1
 ⎕←(⍕result),' item(s) were processed'
